  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1.4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 1.4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif hine mon togenedan scyle, ⁊ he elles nylle, gif hine mon gebinde, þolige his wæpna ⁊ his ierfes.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If he has to be forced thither, and he resists, if he needs to be bound, let him forfeit his weapons and his property.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If he will not submit unless force is used against him, [i.e.] if he has to be bound, he shall forfeit his weapons and his property.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif hine man togenydan scyle, ⁊ he elles nylle, gif hine man gebinde, þolie his wæpna and his yrfes.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
